# BAS narrowing: [str? x] in if-condition narrows x to Str in the true branch,
# and to Type::Negation(Str) in the false branch via apply_negation_narrowings.
# This complements bas_negation_narrowing.llt-eval (which tests int?/Negation(Int)).
[greet: [fn [x] [if [str? x] [str "Hello, " x] "not a string"]]
 r1: [greet "World"]
 r2: [greet 42]]
=== out
Dict({"greet": Function(x), "r1": String("Hello, World"), "r2": String("not a string")})
